think about: blackout curtains. That's a book to read, the things that are

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:47.450
important. That is your own siren. That is the one which will warn you of an air

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:52.330
raid. And when it sounds, please, and this is terribly

00:05:52.330 --> 00:06:00.000
important, get moving. I've worked out your first week's menus in 1939. That is

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:05.400
is a typical menu of what we would have had and cooked for a family.

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:08.100
Have you seen chocolate cake? I can't make a cake.

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:14.000
I'm sure you can. No Yorkshire women that are born who can't make a cake.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:16.400
Am I right? I bet she's good.

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:20.520
I've never known her. For 29 years, I've never known her to bake a cake.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:23.520
Ah, well, then you'll have to explore the possibilities.

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:26.410
I've never seen two ladies look so horrified.

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:28.420
Well, it's amazing.

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:30.000
I think we might have to get into it.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:36.760
Well, I think we've got a splendid family. They're ready to work hard, and by joke we worked hard during those years.

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:43.820
The family haven't quite the same emotional problems, people in danger and worrying all the time about the news,

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:52.700
but they have the other problems of making do, and they've suddenly stepped from a life where they had all their labour-saving appliances

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:58.610
to a life where we really didn't have them. We had support from everyone around us.

00:06:58.610 --> 00:07:00.000
but they're doing

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:18.170
all by themselves I've always had an interest in the home front during the

00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:23.270
forties and often wondered what it would have been like to live through that time

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:28.280
so this is a bit of a dream come true really well you've hit the jackpot yeah

