00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:32.510
I don't want to love it.

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:34.190
It won't be too bad, we can move these together.

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:35.050
No, I don't want to.

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:36.780
Oh, wonderful.

