01:34:32.950 --> 01:34:41.200
I've made a dark chocolate cake and a sultana orange cake and some jam tarts.

01:34:41.200 --> 01:34:45.970
Oh, well, people said you didn't make cakes.

01:34:45.970 --> 01:34:51.060
Well, no, I have never ever made a cake till I came to this house.

01:34:51.060 --> 01:34:54.930
In fact, I've never made as much as this in my entire life.

01:34:54.930 --> 01:34:57.270
Well, isn't your mother clever, Mary?

01:34:57.270 --> 01:35:00.000
And do tell me about these, they look absolutely fascinating.

01:35:00.000 --> 01:35:08.630
Well, those are sausage meat and apple. It was actually for sandwich filling to make sandwiches, but I decided to make tarts with them.

01:35:08.750 --> 01:35:13.670
I congratulate you and raise my cup of tea in tune to the both you've done jolly well.

01:35:13.870 --> 01:35:24.640
The war years were times of problems, but I think it gave many of us a chance to discover debts which we didn't know we had, talents we didn't know we had before.

01:35:24.640 --> 01:35:30.000
And I think both Kirsty and Lynn typifies how women cope.

01:35:30.700 --> 01:35:36.340
Kerstes, who'd never baked much before, now has discovered this talent for baking,

01:35:36.760 --> 01:35:42.370
and then has done sterling work, going to nursing homes and talking to old people.

01:35:43.400 --> 01:35:46.680
Typified the way women cope during those war years.

01:35:47.070 --> 01:35:49.740
Pretty good sex we were. We managed beautifully.

01:35:51.580 --> 01:35:59.440
Someday, when I'm awfully low, when the world is cold,

01:36:00.280 --> 01:36:10.140
i will feel a glow just thinking i have to say this is an interesting sort of journey for me

01:36:10.140 --> 01:36:15.230
and perhaps for all of us i'm finding my own strengths i'm finding my own weaknesses

01:36:15.230 --> 01:36:23.210
and it's changing me yeah we've had a lot of physical hard work and mental hard work

01:36:23.770 --> 01:36:30.000
but at least we can say at the end of it that we did it there is nothing i felt proud of my daughter

01:36:30.000 --> 01:36:33.940
for the way she coped with everything and the way she handled everything very

01:36:33.940 --> 01:36:39.060
proud and that's a nice feeling for me as a mother and I must remember to tell her

01:37:18.650 --> 01:37:23.690
entered into this 1940s project that it would have such a great impact on our

01:37:23.690 --> 01:37:30.000
lives it's just made me look at things in a totally different light

01:37:30.000 --> 01:37:49.030
it was nine weeks living on the edge really six months after their mock war

